{{smaller block|⟦2000⟧''Automatic Coal Weighing Machine'' (fig. 18).—This machine weighs the coal delivered into factories, &c., by charges up to 20 cwt. at a time, and records and sums up the weights of the charges so as to exhibit the total weight delivered. The whole of this work is effected automatically.}}

